  "description": "Al Qiam Gold is a bold and luxurious fragrance that blends juicy fruits with rich leather and deep oud warmth. The scent is powerful and sophisticated, offering a unique Middle Eastern character with a modern twist. The opening introduces a striking combination of sweet raspberry and warm saffron, creating a vibrant and slightly spicy fruity accord. The heart develops into smooth leather and earthy patchouli, adding depth, richness, and a refined masculine-leaning elegance. The base settles into a deep blend of oud, amber, benzoin, vetiver, and guaiac wood, delivering a warm, smoky, and long-lasting woody finish. Al Qiam Gold is perfect for those who enjoy bold leather-oud fragrances with a touch of fruity sweetness and strong presence.",
